<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-12">
    <div class="glass-card p-8 md:p-12 rounded-2xl border-t-4 border-[#D4AF37]">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#D4AF37] mb-3">Legal</p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4 brand-font">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-10">Last updated: September 15, 2026. This privacy policy is published by Future Music Collective (Fox Parton) for the Meta Horizon Store application <strong class="text-white">Battle Sphere Arena</strong>, other Future Music Collective Horizon Store apps including Blockbuilder, and the website futuremusic.online.</p>

        <div class="space-y-8 text-gray-300 leading-relaxed font-light">
            <section>
                <h2 class="text-xl text-[#D4AF37] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Who we are</h2>
                <p>Future Music Collective operates <strong class="text-white">Battle Sphere Arena</strong>, a virtual-reality game distributed on the Meta Horizon Store, and the website at <a class="text-[#D4AF37] underline" href="https://futuremusic.online">https://futuremusic.online</a>. We also publish other Horizon Store apps, including Blockbuilder. This page explains what data we collect, how we use it, and how you can ask us to delete it.</p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="text-xl text-[#D4AF37] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Battle Sphere Arena on Meta Quest</h2>
                <p class="mb-3"><strong class="text-white">Battle Sphere Arena</strong> is a native Quest application. It is sold only through the Meta Horizon Store. Digital content and functionality in the Quest app are not sold on this website and are not unlocked by any payment processor other than Meta.</p>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
                    <li>The app does not require a Future Music Collective account.</li>
                    <li>The app does not show ads and does not include third-party advertising SDKs from us.</li>
                    <li>Progress, settings, and save data stay on your headset unless you choose to export a file or send it to us.</li>
                    <li>We do not process in-app payments inside <strong class="text-white">Battle Sphere Arena</strong>. If you buy the app or any in-app digital items, Meta processes that purchase under Meta’s terms and privacy policy.</li>
                    <li>The app does not load futuremusic.online in order to play.</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="text-xl text-[#D4AF37] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">What data we collect</h2>
                <p class="mb-3">From the <strong class="text-white">Battle Sphere Arena</strong> Quest app itself, we do not collect personal information. Headset, store, and platform telemetry for a Horizon Store install is handled by Meta, not by us.</p>
                <p class="mb-3">If you use the website or contact us, we collect only what we need to run those services:</p>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
                    <li><strong class="text-white">Account data</strong> if you register on the website: name or display name, email address, and a hashed password. We do not store your raw password.</li>
                    <li><strong class="text-white">Website order data</strong> if you buy physical merch or other website-only products: items, amounts, and fulfillment details. Card numbers for those website orders are processed by our website payment processor. We do not see or store full payment-card numbers. Website orders are not a way to buy <strong class="text-white">Battle Sphere Arena</strong> for Quest.</li>
                    <li><strong class="text-white">Contact messages</strong> you send through our contact form: name, email, subject, and message body.</li>
                    <li><strong class="text-white">Cookies and similar storage</strong> used to keep you logged in or remember a merch cart on the website.</li>
                    <li><strong class="text-white">Technical logs</strong> when you load our website pages: IP address, date and time, requested URL, referrer, and browser or headset user-agent. These are ordinary web-server logs.</li>
                    <li><strong class="text-white">Advertising data on some website pages</strong> (not inside the Quest app): Google AdSense and similar partners may set cookies and collect device identifiers as described in their own policies.</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="text-xl text-[#D4AF37] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">How we use data</h2>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
                    <li>To operate, secure, and improve the website and <strong class="text-white">Battle Sphere Arena</strong>.</li>
                    <li>To create and maintain your account if you register on the website.</li>
                    <li>To fulfill website merch orders and send receipts for those website orders.</li>
                    <li>To answer messages you send us, including privacy and deletion requests.</li>
                    <li>To diagnose errors, prevent abuse, and meet legal obligations.</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="mt-3">We do not sell your personal information. We do not use <strong class="text-white">Battle Sphere Arena</strong> save files for advertising.</p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="text-xl text-[#D4AF37] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Who else sees data</h2>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
                    <li><strong class="text-white">Hosting and delivery</strong> for futuremusic.online (currently Google Cloud Run and related infrastructure).</li>
                    <li><strong class="text-white">Website payment processing</strong> for merch and other website-only orders. This is not used to sell <strong class="text-white">Battle Sphere Arena</strong> on Quest.</li>
                    <li><strong class="text-white">Email delivery</strong> to receive contact-form messages.</li>
                    <li><strong class="text-white">Meta</strong> if you install <strong class="text-white">Battle Sphere Arena</strong> (or another of our apps, including Blockbuilder) from the Meta Horizon Store. Meta’s platform policies and privacy policy apply to your Meta account, headset telemetry, and store purchases.</li>
                    <li><strong class="text-white">Advertising partners</strong> on some website pages, as noted above. The Quest app does not include those partners.</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="text-xl text-[#D4AF37] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">How long we keep data</h2>
                <p>Website account and order records are kept while the account is open and for a limited period afterward as needed for accounting, chargebacks, and legal requirements. Server logs are rotated on a routine schedule. Contact messages are kept long enough to reply and follow up. Local <strong class="text-white">Battle Sphere Arena</strong> saves remain on your device until you clear app data or uninstall the app.</p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="text-xl text-[#D4AF37] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">How to request deletion of your data</h2>
                <p class="mb-3">You may request that we delete personal data we have collected or stored about you. To do that:</p>
                <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-2">
                    <li>Open <a class="text-[#D4AF37] underline" href="/contact">https://futuremusic.online/contact</a>.</li>
                    <li>Send a message that includes the email you used with us, the app name if relevant (<strong class="text-white">Battle Sphere Arena</strong>), and the words “delete my data” or “privacy deletion request.”</li>
                    <li>We will confirm and delete account records, contact messages, and other personal data we control, except information we must retain for legal, security, or accounting reasons (for example, a paid website invoice).</li>
                </ol>
                <p class="mt-3">You can delete locally stored <strong class="text-white">Battle Sphere Arena</strong> data yourself by clearing the app’s data on the headset or uninstalling <strong class="text-white">Battle Sphere Arena</strong>. Horizon Store purchase history is controlled by Meta. If you have a website account, the same contact request can close the account.</p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="text-xl text-[#D4AF37] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Children</h2>
                <p>The website and <strong class="text-white">Battle Sphere Arena</strong> are not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If you believe a child has given us personal information, contact us using the deletion steps above and we will delete it.</p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="text-xl text-[#D4AF37] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Changes</h2>
                <p>We may update this privacy policy. The “Last updated” date at the top will change when we do. Continued use of the site or <strong class="text-white">Battle Sphere Arena</strong> after an update means you have read the revised policy.</p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2 class="text-xl text-[#D4AF37] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Contact</h2>
                <p>Questions about this privacy policy, data collection, or deletion for <strong class="text-white">Battle Sphere Arena</strong>: <a class="text-[#D4AF37] underline" href="/contact">https://futuremusic.online/contact</a>. Terms of service: <a class="text-[#D4AF37] underline" href="/terms">https://futuremusic.online/terms</a>.</p>
            </section>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

